<title>USA: U.S consumer confidence 118.4 in Feb vs rvsd 118.7.</title>
<headline>U.S consumer confidence 118.4 in Feb vs rvsd 118.7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The index of U.S. consumer confidence slipped to 118.4 in February, down from a revised reading of 118.7 in January, the Conference Board said on Tuesday.</p>
